# Maintenance scripts — not public content.
#
# regression.sh was downloadable over the web and contains the test account's
# credentials in plaintext, and build_assets.php could be triggered by anyone.
# Deny everything by default; the two admin-run PHP tools are re-allowed below
# and enforce their own requireAdmin() check on top of this.

Require all denied

# Admin-run maintenance tools. Web access is required because InfinityFree
# gives no shell — but each one calls requireAdmin() before doing anything.
<FilesMatch "^(build_assets|recompress_avatars)\.php$">
    Require all granted
</FilesMatch>
